# Problem 10 – Linear Search vs Binary Search

| Linear Search | Binary Search |
|--------------|---------------|
| Checks every element | Checks the middle element |
| Works on sorted & unsorted lists | Works only on sorted lists |
| Simpler | Slightly more complex |
| Slower for large lists | Faster for large sorted lists |

